## Repository layout

```
{{ project_slug }}/
├── models/
│   ├── src/        editable source models -- the structure
│   └── export/     tool exports generated from src/
├── models/config/
│   ├── parameters/ parameter values
│   ├── lookups/    table functions
│   ├── scenarios/  scenario-specific overrides
│   └── timeseries/ reference data
├── runners/{% for t in tools %}
│   └── {{ t }}/{{ ' ' * (10 - t | length) }}how to run the model with {{ t }}{% endfor %}
├── scripts/        helpers (CSV -> .cin, comparison, plotting)
├── tests/
├── results/        run output; binary tool files stay out
└── docs/
```

The rule the layout encodes: **`models/` holds structure, `models/config/` holds
numbers, `results/` holds nothing worth keeping.** Anything in `results/` must
be re-creatable from `models/` + `models/config/` + `runners/`. If it is not,
something is missing from the repository.

